'''Helena''' is a [[Miss Nanny (Fallout 76)|Miss Nanny]] serving as a [[Fallout 76 vendors|vendor]] at [[the Whitespring Resort]] in [[Appalachia]].

==Background==
Helena is one of the robotic vendors the Whitespring Resort replaced their human staff with shortly before the [[Great War]].<ref>[[The Whitespring 2080 Initiative]]</ref> She resides in the Aurum store of the Whitespring's mall area. She mainly sells jewelry, including [[Silver pocket watch (Fallout 76)|silver]] and [[gold pocket watch]]es, as well as spoons.

